  "bodyHash": "ga83/oNJQWE=",
  "content": "<p><span>別忘了你需要使用&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/1496369-151-147update-44-mcpatcher-hd-fix-303-01-245-04/\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCPatcher</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/249637-151-optifine-hd-b3-fps-boost-hd-textures-aa-af-and-much-more/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>&nbsp;才能讓這個材質包完美呈現，因為它使用了連接紋理。</span><br><br>大家好，<br><br>FancyCraft 剛剛變得更加華麗了！沒錯，就是這樣。有幾款原始材質困擾我很久了，比如門，它們一點都不華麗。但現在不再是這樣了。我已經開始重新製作一些不合格的原始材質。我要把華麗程度調到最高！來看看新的門，還有新的鵝卵石和石磚。希望你們喜歡。未來還會有更多更新哦！<br><br>JJJas0n 在 Minecraft 還很早期的時候就開始了這個美妙的材質包。FancyCraft 一直以來都是最頂尖的高清材質包之一。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.dropbox.com%252fs%252fhdfdgw9bll3qb5j%252fScreenshot%2b2014-05-06%2b06.22.27.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">我已經徵得 JJJason 的許可，重新啟動這個品牌。</a><br><br>其他人也曾努力延續這個材質包，但最終都放棄了。我從 JJJas0n 的最後一個版本重新開始。我努力保持 FancyCraft 初始時的高標準。請告訴我我是否成功做到了，以及哪些地方還不夠好。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/629/128x-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br>x128 截圖感謝&nbsp;<a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/project/kabs-resource-pack-showcase/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kab's Resource Pack Showcase</a>！<br><br>原始材質包的鳴謝：</p><ul>\n<li>字體來自 Misa 的材質包</li>\n<li>水、岩漿和環境材質來自 Scuttle 的材質包。他好心允許我使用這些材質；它們看起來很棒。</li>\n<li>這個材質包受到 Misa 和 Scuttle 的啟發。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/630/2016-02-25_06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><br>授權 / 許可（法律上的繁文縟節）：</p><ul>\n<li>如需在其他材質包中重新使用本材質包的內容，請先取得許可。</li>\n<li>如需重新發布本內容，請先取得許可。</li>\n<li>如需撰寫附截圖的評論，請標註出處並連結至此頁面。</li>\n<li>如需使用本內容製作影片，請標註出處並連結至此頁面。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/9/531/6440225889_c66d97a9f1_b.jpg\" alt=\"undefined\"><br><br>請告訴我你喜歡什麼，特別是，你不喜歡什麼。對於那些不對勁的地方，如果你能告訴我為什麼不對，我很有可能會修正它，至少會盡力嘗試。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/631/2016-02-25_06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/632/2016-02-25_06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/633/2016-02-25_06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/634/2016-02-25_06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/635/2016-02-25_06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/32/636/2016-02-25_06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1028\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這些都是我所有的材質包，我敢打賭一定有你會喜歡的：&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/76115-axels-forgotten-lands-resource-p\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Axel's Forgotten Lands Realistic Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fortune-glory-jungle-ruins-textu/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Fortune &amp; Glory Jungle Ruins Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kab-pack-adventure/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 KabPack Adventure Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/236085-lord-trilobites-norsecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Lord Trilobite's Viking Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/darklands-medieval/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Darklands Medieval Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/even-time-x32-resource-pack/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 evenTime Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/223572-curse-cobalt-web-forms-textfield\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Athos Roman Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ad-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 TheVoid's AD-Reforged RPG Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/soulscribes-rezcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 Soulscribe's RezCraft Tron Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/221074-mrshortees-bladecraft-cyberpunk-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 MrShortee's Bladecraft Cyberpunk Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Xaiwaker:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/222577-xaiwaker-x16-swirly-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Swirly Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/222516-xaiwaker-x32-swirly-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Swirly Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>The Doctor:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/the-doctor-x16-whovian-texture-p/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16 Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/the-doctor-x32-whovian-texture-p/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/the-doctor-x32-tardis-2-0-resource-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 TARDIS 2.0 Map Whovian Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's&nbsp;Photobased:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x16-calorie-reduced/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x16&nbsp;Photobased&nbsp;Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-photo-based/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 PhotobasedResource Pack</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's Technic:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-tekkit/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Classic 3.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/k32-tekkit-classic-313/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Classic 3.1.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-tekkit-lite-0-5-9/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Lite 0.6.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-tekkit-a-new-fron/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit 1.2.9g</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/kyctarniqs-tekkit-legends-texture-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Tekkit Legends 1.1.1</a></li>\n<li><strong>Kyctarniq's FTB:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-mindcrack-tex/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Mindcrack 1.4.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-ultimate-text/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Ultimate 1.4.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/kyctarniqs-x32-ftb-direwolf20-re/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Direwolf20 1.7.10</a></li>\n<li><strong>FancyCraft:</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fancy-craft-x32-classy-resource/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x32 Classy Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/fancy-craft-x64-classy-resource/\" rel=\"nofollow\">x64 Classy Resource Pack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/texture-packs/79523-fancy-craft-x128-classy-resource\" rel=\"nofollow\">x128 Classy Resource Pack</a></li>\n</ul>",
